ternal.SmoothPieceEpsCompression.halfPart","Breakdown.cdot"],"used_by":["Breakdown.Coercive.Internal.SmoothPieceEpsCompression.compression_of_product","Breakdown.Coercive.Internal.SmoothPieceEpsCompression.halfPairing_eq","Breakdown.Coercive.Internal.SmoothPieceEpsCompression.partial_eq","Breakdown.Coercive.Internal.SmoothPieceEpsCompression.symbol_pairing_bound","Breakdown.CoerciveWeak.Internal.PieceEpsStretch.compression_self_split","Breakdown.CoerciveWeak.Internal.PieceEpsStretch.tsum_pair_im"],"uses":["Breakdown.Coercive.Internal.SmoothPieceEpsCompression.halfPart","Breakdown.cdot"],"written":"halfPairing"}],"imports":["Breakdown.Cert.CoerciveSmoothPieceEpsCompressionAssembly"],"module":"Breakdown.Cert.CoerciveSmoothPieceEpsCompressionSymbolDefs","path":"Breakdown/Cert/CoerciveSmoothPieceEpsCompressionSymbolDefs.lean","sha256":"38777f069043137bd2a6e00974ed78f7a6c546479b2f8bbfa9f57c5ef1a6e14a","source":"import Breakdown.Cert.CoerciveSmoothPieceEpsCompressionAssembly\n\nopen scoped ContDiff ENNReal\nopen MeasureTheory\n\nnoncomputable section\n\nnamespace Breakdown\n\nnamespace Coercive\n\nnamespace Internal.SmoothPieceEpsCompression\n\nopen Internal.SmoothPieceEpsCore\n\ndef applyMat {q : Type} [Fintype q] (A : Fin 3 → q → ℂ) (u : q → ℂ) : Fin 3 → ℂ := fun i => ∑ j, A i j * u j\n\ndef torusPhase (β : ℤ × ℤ) (τ φ : ℝ) : ℂ := Complex.exp (((2 * Real.pi * β.1 * τ + β.2 * φ : ℝ) : ℂ) * Complex.I)\n\ndef symbolMat {q : Type} [Fintype q] (H : Finset (ℤ × ℤ)) (A : ℤ × ℤ → Fin 3 → q → ℂ) (τ φ : ℝ) :\n    Fin 3 → q → ℂ :=\n  fun i j => ∑ β ∈ H, torusPhase β τ φ * A β i j\n\nopen Classical in\ndef halfPart {q : Type} [Fintype q] (H : Finset (ℤ × ℤ)) (T : Set (ℤ × ℤ)) (A : ℤ × ℤ → Fin 3 → q → ℂ)\n    (g : ℤ × ℤ → q → ℂ) (ι : ℤ × ℤ) : Fin 3 → ℂ :=\n  ∑ β ∈ H, if ι - β ∈ T then applyMat (A β) (g (ι - β)) else 0\n\nopen Classical in\ndef halfSq {p : Type} [Fintype p] (T : Set (ℤ × ℤ)) (x : ℤ × ℤ → p → ℂ) (ι : ℤ × ℤ) : ℝ :=\n  if ι ∈ T then cnormSq (x ι) else 0\n\nopen Classical in\ndef halfPairing {q : Type} [Fintype q] (H : Finset (ℤ × ℤ)) (T : Set (ℤ × ℤ)) (A : ℤ × ℤ → Fin 3 → q → ℂ)\n    (x : ℤ × ℤ → Fin 3 → ℂ) (g : ℤ × ℤ → q → ℂ) (ι : ℤ × ℤ) : ℂ :=\n  if ι ∈ T then cdot (x ι) (halfPart H T A g ι) else 0\n\nend Internal.SmoothPieceEpsCompression\n\nend Coercive\n\nend Breakdown\n"}